window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Determined not to live her parents’ fate as a mated vampire, Isabelle locks herself away from society.</p> <p>Despite her resolve to avoid anyone outside her family, her world is rocked when Stefan arrives.</p> <p>The powerful, stunning vampire is everything she never wanted.</p> <p>Stefan isn't expecting to walk into a nest full of vampires, but he’s immediately drawn to the vibrant, defiant, and willful Isabelle who goes out of her way to avoid him.</p> <p>No matter how hard she tries to fight it, Isabelle can’t deny the pull she feels toward Stefan. Just as she starts to let down her guard, Stefan’s lethal past catches up to him and threatens to destroy the life Isabelle worked so hard to protect.</p> <p>Will Isabelle and Stefan overcome their differences in time to face the looming danger, or will they lose each other when the past collides with the present?</p>"; 
